      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=139",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Scientific name:</strong> Carlarius latiscutatus (Günther, 1864)</li><li><strong>Common names:</strong> Gambian Sea Catfish, Rough-head Sea Catfish, Ruhovedet Havmalle (Denmark)</li><li><strong>Type locality:</strong> Fernando Póo Island [Bioco Island], Equatorial Guinea, Gulf of Guinea.</li><li><strong>Synonyms:</strong> Arius lagoensis, Arius latiscutatus, Tachysurus lagoensis</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=139",
      "html": "<p>Eastern Atlantic: Dakar, Senegal to Angola; one record from Fernando Poo. Reported from Gambia and the lower Niger basin.</p><p>IUCN Red List category: Least Concern. Last assessed 2019.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "habitat",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=139",
      "html": "<p>Mainly marine but frequently found in brackish estuaries, sometimes enters freshwater.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=139",
      "html": "<p>Feeds on fish, benthic invertebrates, zooplankton and detritus.</p>"
    },
